# HotFox Visual Refinement V4

- Current UI is not visually accepted until 18/18 screenshot evidence and comparison exist.
- Owner override: never use decorative planets, planetary arcs, planetary horizons, eclipses, celestial bodies, or orbital motifs.
- `hf_fox_planet` must have zero production references.
- `hf_shadow_orbits` in its current orbital/celestial form must have zero production references.
- Exact per-screen reference wins over generic tokens, except the newer owner celestial-removal override.
- Asset kit is a parts bin, not automatic visual truth.
- Do not use universal Material defaults as final design.
- Content-over-containers: avoid unnecessary large rounded cards.
- All dark HotFox screens must use light status/navigation bar icons.
- No content may be clipped or hidden behind bottom navigation.
- Do not show vertical scrollbars unless the exact reference does.
- Debug-only screenshot fixtures are allowed under src/debug to produce deterministic visual states, but they must not mutate production VPN, entitlement, payment, server, subscription, traffic, or connection truth.
- Production CONNECTED/Защищено remains gated by real readiness.
- Missing screenshot is not PASS.
- 18/18 references, captures, overlay/diff evidence required before claiming visual completion.
- RELEASE READY remains separate and requires final runtime gates.
